---
import BlogPostLayout from '../../../../layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro';

const title = "Questions to Ask Yourself Before Choosing a Career in India";
const seoTitle = "Questions to Ask Yourself Before Choosing a Career in India: A Checklist";
const description = "Questions to ask yourself before choosing a career in India: interests, strengths, values, money, family and market checks, with a one-page worksheet you can finish in an evening.";
const seoDescription = "Ten honest questions across interests, strengths, values, money and market give a clearer choice.";
const canonical = "https://futurecareerschool.com/blog/career-guidance/questions-to-ask-yourself-before-choosing-a-career-india/";
const publishedDateISO = "2026-10-30";
const publishedDateLabel = "30 October 2026";
const authorName = "Shivanshi Sehgal";
const authorUrl = "https://futurecareerschool.com/about/shivanshi-sehgal/";
const authorRole = "Career researcher and writer";

const faqItems = [
  [
    "What questions should I ask before choosing a career?",
    "Ask about interests, strengths, values, resources and market demand."
  ],
  [
    "How many options should I compare?",
    "Two or three is enough."
  ],
  [
    "What if my answers conflict?",
    "Use trials to find which answer is stronger in practice."
  ],
  [
    "Should I include family views?",
    "Yes, as one input. Decide using your own written answers too."
  ],
  [
    "How long should this take?",
    "One evening for answers and a few weeks for trials."
  ],
  [
    "What if I have no strong interest?",
    "Start with strengths and values, then trial."
  ],
  [
    "Do tests help?",
    "They can start a list, but trials matter more."
  ],
  [
    "Can AI answer these for me?",
    "AI can prompt you. The answers must be yours."
  ]
];

const faqJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({
    "@type": "Question",
    name: item.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: item.a },
  })),
};
---

<BlogPostLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  seoTitle={seoTitle}
  seoDescription={seoDescription}
  canonical={canonical}
  category="career-guidance"
  publishedAt={publishedDateISO}
  publishedLabel={publishedDateLabel}
  authorName={authorName}
  authorUrl={authorUrl}
  authorRole={authorRole}
  jsonLdExtras={[faqJsonLd]}
>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Ten honest questions, written down, cover what you enjoy, what you do well, what you value, what you can afford and what the market asks for.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Short answer:</strong> Ten honest questions across interests, strengths, values, money and market give a clearer choice.</li>
      <li><strong>Evidence:</strong> This page quotes no statistics or pay figures and was not built from fetched sources. Ten live notices and two conversations, as set out below, are the best way to get current local evidence.</li>
      <li><strong>Growth:</strong> Clear proof and finished work support an earlier path to financial freedom.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>
    This guide is part of our set of <a href="/blog/career-options/">career option guides</a>. Read it with <a href="/blog/career-guidance/what-career-should-i-choose/">what career should I choose</a>, <a href="/blog/career-guidance/how-to-choose-between-two-career-options-india/">how to choose between two career options</a> and <a href="/blog/skills/how-to-find-which-skills-are-in-demand-in-india/">how to find which skills are in demand</a>.
  </p>

